<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="{{@site.locale}}">

<head>
    <meta charset="utf-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
    <title>{{statusCode}} — {{message}}</title>
    {{!-- Standalone on purpose. An error template that depends on the theme layout, the
         asset pipeline or a helper would produce a misleading error when one of those is
         what broke, so everything here is inline and only context data is interpolated
         (no {{asset}}, no {{t}}, no partials). error-404.hbs is the exception: a 404 may
         use the full theme, and does. --}}
    <style>
        :root { color-scheme: dark; }
        * { box-sizing: border-box; }
        body {
            margin: 0;
            min-height: 100vh;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            padding: 2rem;
            background: #0d0e11;
            color: #f3f4f6;
            font-family: Inter, ui-sans-serif, system-ui, -apple-system, "Segoe UI", Roboto, sans-serif;
            line-height: 1.6;
        }
        main { max-width: 34rem; text-align: center; }
        .code {
            font-family: "Roboto Mono", ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, Consolas, monospace;
            font-size: 4rem;
            font-weight: 700;
            letter-spacing: -0.02em;
            margin: 0 0 0.5rem;
            color: #ffffff;
        }
        .message { margin: 0 0 1.5rem; font-size: 1.125rem; color: #9ca3af; }
        .hint { margin: 0 0 2rem; font-size: 0.875rem; color: #6b7280; }
        a {
            display: inline-block;
            padding: 0.6rem 1.25rem;
            border-radius: 0.5rem;
            background: #7d27d9;
            color: #ffffff;
            font-size: 0.875rem;
            font-weight: 600;
            text-decoration: none;
        }
        a:hover { background: #9333ea; }
        a:focus-visible { outline: 2px solid #3b82f6; outline-offset: 2px; }
    </style>
</head>

<body>
    <main>
        <p class="code">{{statusCode}}</p>
        <p class="message">{{message}}</p>
        <p class="hint">{{@site.title}}</p>
        <a href="{{@site.url}}">Go to the front page</a>
    </main>
</body>

</html>
